<title>NETHERLANDS: Aegon says EPS boosted by Providian buy.</title>
<headline>Aegon says EPS boosted by Providian buy.</headline>
<dateline>THE HAGUE 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch insurer Aegon said on Monday its purchase of Providian Corp's insurance activities would have an &quot;immediate positive effect on its earnings per share&quot;.</p>
<p>Aegon said in a statement it would acquire the activities, worth $3.5 billion, in a deal involving the tax-free exchange of shares.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam Newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
